codedb.snapshot
# The local package server's fetch cache. A `zig fetch` of a URL-and-hash
# package extracts under `zig-pkg/` next to the checkout that asks for it, so
# this is a cache and never a source directory: it holds one copy of the
# package per fetch, and every copy differs from the tree it was built from as
# soon as that tree moves.
zig-pkg/
# Generated by tools/link-oracle.sh and cargo. The vendor symlinks point at a
# machine specific checkout, so they must never be committed.
tools/oracle/vendor/
tools/oracle/target/
